  "notes": "M.P. Evans Group plc (AIM, USD functional/reporting; GBp listing). Pure-play Indonesian palm oil; ~54,500 ha planted (~134.6k acres total inc nucleus + plasma). UK semi-annual reporter (H1 June + FY December). Revenue almost entirely CPO + PK from Sumatra and Kalimantan estates. Net cash balance sheet. Hectares converted to thousand acres \u00d7 2.47. MPE began publishing 'fair value' indicative property figure in 2023 ARA (~$700M biological assets + bearer plants). MP Evans was incorporated 1884 (Wallace Brothers) and listed on LSE 1996 as M.P. Evans Group following demerger from Bertam plantations / Rowe Evans. Pre-2008 reporting was GBP under UK GAAP; transitioned to IFRS + USD reporting in 2008. Earlier figures restated approx to USD at average annual GBP/USD. Australian beef-cattle interests divested 2017 to focus on palm. H1 cadence began consistently from 2003. Operating expense breakdown (Cost of sales / Administrative expenses / Other operating costs) drawn from consolidated income statement of MPE annual reports filed on mpevans.co.uk IR archive; H1 interims do not split categories so field omitted there.",
